# 15. AI Chat Flow

```text
User Message

↓

Authentication

↓

Intent Detection

↓

Planner Agent

↓

Query Rewriting

↓

Hybrid Retrieval

↓

Context Ranking

↓

Prompt Builder

↓

LLM Provider

↓

Reviewer Agent

↓

Response Formatter

↓

Streaming Response

↓

Save Conversation

↓

Background Memory Update
```

Fast-path routing allows simple conversational messages such as greetings to bypass retrieval, reducing latency.

Reviewer failures loop back to the Planner with the validation critique until the retry limit is reached.

