# 16. Document Upload Flow

```text
Upload Request

↓

Authentication

↓

File Validation

↓

Store Original File

↓

Create Database Record

↓

Extract Text

↓

Chunk Generation

↓

Embedding Generation

↓

Store in ChromaDB

↓

Processing Complete

↓

Generate Insights (Background)
```

If ingestion fails during any stage, cleanup workers remove partially created chunks and embeddings to maintain synchronization between PostgreSQL and ChromaDB.

